            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "mable",
            "lines": [
                "You're not the brightest one, are you? Whoever has the most Pokémon and the most energy will come out on top!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "mable",
            "lines": [
                "Lazy people who just wait for things to be handed to them don't get to have these resources!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "But why is Team Flare amassing Pokémon, energy, and money?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "To put it another way, why is Team Flare always trying to take everything for itself?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
